tion, drawing them into the story. <em>(felkelt \/ \u00f6szt\u00f6n\u00f6z)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">izgat \/ felkelt \/ lelkes\u00edt<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): nyugtat \/ csillap\u00edt \/ lelohaszt<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ interest = \u00e9rdekl\u0151d\u00e9st felkelt (pl. The new exhibit aims to _______ interest in ancient history.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ suspicion = gyan\u00fat kelt (pl. His strange behavior began to _______ suspicion among his colleagues.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ the imagination = felkelti a k\u00e9pzeletet (pl. The mysterious old house continued to _______ the imagination of the children.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a reaction = reakci\u00f3t v\u00e1lt ki (pl. The controversial statement was sure to _______ a strong reaction from the public.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>excite<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>exciting<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>excitedly<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>excitement<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>excite<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: excite interest \/ excite suspicion \/ excite the imagination \/ excite a reaction<\/span><\/p><p>similar: arouse \/ stimulate \/ provoke \/ thrill<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: calm \/ soothe \/ bore<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"excite","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":4,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-14","due_at":"2026-06-18T15:17:51+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-13T16:43:00+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":5,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-13"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"5 nap","good":"10 nap","easy":"13 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-25T20:18:11+00:00"},{"id":51430,"front":"<p>Excuse me, could you tell me where the nearest _______ is? <em>(mosd\u00f3 \/ WC)<\/em><\/p><p>The airplane&#039;s _______ was temporarily out of order during the flight. <em>(rep\u00fcl\u0151g\u00e9p mosd\u00f3ja \/ fed\u00e9lzeti WC)<\/em><\/p><p>Guests are kindly requested to keep the communal _______ clean and tidy. <em>(k\u00f6z\u00f6s mell\u00e9khelyis\u00e9g \/ k\u00f6z\u00f6s illemhely)<\/em><\/p><p>After a long journey, the first thing I looked for upon arrival was a clean and accessible _______. <em>(mell\u00e9khelyis\u00e9g \/ WC)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">mosd\u00f3 \/ WC \/ mell\u00e9khelyis\u00e9g<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): tisztas\u00e1g \/ higi\u00e9nia \/ rend<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 public _______ = nyilv\u00e1nos WC (pl. The city needs more clean public _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 airplane _______ = rep\u00fcl\u0151g\u00e9p WC-je (pl. The airplane _______ was occupied.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 men&#039;s _______ = f\u00e9rfi WC (pl. The sign pointed to the men&#039;s _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ladies&#039; _______ = n\u0151i WC (pl. She asked for directions to the ladies&#039; _______.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>lavatory<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>lavatory<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: public lavatory \/ airplane lavatory \/ men&#039;s lavatory \/ ladies&#039; lavatory<\/span><\/p><p>similar: toilet \/ restroom \/ washroom \/ WC<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: cleanliness \/ hygiene \/ order<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"lavatory","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":4,"ease_factor":265,"repetitions":2,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-14","due_at":"2026-06-18T15:17:53+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-06-14T10:45:51+00:00","interval":1,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-13"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"5 nap","good":"11 nap","easy":"14 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-19T08:08:51+00:00"},{"id":51438,"front":"<p>It was a _______ coincidence that we met at the airport; we hadn&#039;t planned it. <em>(puszta \/ v\u00e9letlen)<\/em><\/p><p>The _______ fact that he was present doesn&#039;t prove his guilt. <em>(csup\u00e1n \/ egyszer\u0171en)<\/em><\/p><p>Despite the elaborate packaging, the product itself was a _______ disappointment. <em>(tiszta \/ teljes)<\/em><\/p><p>He dismissed her concerns as _______ sentimentality, not real problems. <em>(csup\u00e1n \/ egyszer\u0171)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">puszta \/ csup\u00e1n \/ egyszer\u0171<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): jelent\u0151s \/ fontos \/ l\u00e9nyeges<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a _______ coincidence = puszta v\u00e9letlen (pl. It was a _______ coincidence that we both wore red.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 the _______ fact = a puszta t\u00e9ny (pl. The _______ fact that he smiled doesn&#039;t mean he agreed.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ numbers = puszta sz\u00e1mok (pl. _______ numbers don&#039;t always tell the whole story.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a _______ formality = puszta formalit\u00e1s (pl. Signing the document was a _______ formality.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>mere<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>mere<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>merely<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: mere existence \/ mere chance \/ mere words \/ mere suggestion<\/span><\/p><p>similar: only \/ simple \/ nothing more than \/ bare<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: significant \/ substantial \/ important<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"mere","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":1,"ease_factor":230,"repetitions":1,"lapses":1,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-10","reviewed_on":"2026-06-17","due_at":"2026-06-17T20:30:06+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-17T20:20:02+00:00","interval":1,"ease_factor":230,"repetitions":1,"lapses":1,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-10","reviewed_on":"2026-06-17"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"1 nap","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-19T08:10:46+00:00"},{"id":51433,"front":"<p>Many people still use flip phones, but the technology is quite _______ now. <em>(elavult \/ r\u00e9gim\u00f3di)<\/em><\/p><p>The company&#039;s marketing strategies became _______ after the rise of social media. <em>(idej\u00e9tm\u00falt \/ nem hat\u00e9kony)<\/em><\/p><p>Some historical laws are considered _______ and are rarely enforced in modern society. <em>(elavult \/ \u00e9rv\u00e9ny\u00e9t vesztett)<\/em><\/p><p>Her fashion sense was a bit _______, favoring styles from two decades ago. <em>(r\u00e9gies \/ divatjam\u00falt)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">elavult \/ idej\u00e9tm\u00falt \/ r\u00e9gim\u00f3di<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): modern \/ korszer\u0171 \/ aktu\u00e1lis<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 become _______ = elavultt\u00e1 v\u00e1lik (pl. The software will become _______ if not updated regularly.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 an _______ system = egy elavult rendszer (pl. They are replacing an _______ system with a new one.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ technology = elavult technol\u00f3gia (pl. Many companies are still using _______ technology.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ ideas = elavult n\u00e9zetek\/\u00f6tletek (pl. We need to challenge _______ ideas about gender roles.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>outdated<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>outdated<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: outdated technology \/ outdated system \/ outdated ideas \/ outdated methods<\/span><\/p><p>similar: obsolete \/ old-fashioned \/ archaic \/ dated<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: modern \/ current \/ up-to-date<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"outdated","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"ease_factor":235,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-16","due_at":"2026-06-18T08:09:33+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-06-15T15:17:43+00:00","interval":1,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-14"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"5 nap","easy":"6 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-19T08:10:13+00:00"},{"id":51426,"front":"<p>The boxer adopted a wide, stable _______ before throwing the punch. <em>(testtart\u00e1s \/ poz\u00edci\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p>The government&#039;s _______ on environmental protection has drawn criticism from activists. <em>(\u00e1ll\u00e1spont \/ hozz\u00e1\u00e1ll\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p>In his academic paper, he outlined his _______ on the controversial theory, providing extensive evidence. <em>(n\u00e9z\u0151pont \/ v\u00e9lem\u00e9ny)<\/em><\/p><p>Her defiant _______ in the face of adversity inspired many. <em>(ki\u00e1ll\u00e1s \/ magatart\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">\u00e1ll\u00e1spont \/ testtart\u00e1s \/ hozz\u00e1\u00e1ll\u00e1s<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): bizonytalans\u00e1g \/ ingadoz\u00e1s \/ passzivit\u00e1s<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 take a _______ = \u00e1ll\u00e1st foglal (pl. The company decided to take a firm _______ on the issue.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 adopt a _______ = felvesz egy testtart\u00e1st \/ \u00e1ll\u00e1spontot (pl. He adopted a defensive _______ during the debate.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 firm _______ = hat\u00e1rozott \u00e1ll\u00e1spont (pl. The president maintained a firm _______ against the rebels.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 defensive _______ = v\u00e9dekez\u0151 testtart\u00e1s \/ \u00e1ll\u00e1spont (pl. His defensive _______ made it difficult to have a productive conversation.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>stance<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>stance<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: take a stance \/ adopt a stance \/ firm stance \/ defensive stance<\/span><\/p><p>similar: posture \/ position \/ viewpoint \/ attitude<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: indecision \/ wavering \/ flexibility<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":1,"ease_factor":230,"repetitions":1,"lapses":1,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-08","reviewed_on":"2026-06-17","due_at":"2026-06-17T20:29:45+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"relearning","due_at":"2026-06-17T20:18:48+00:00","interval":1,"ease_factor":230,"repetitions":1,"lapses":1,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-08","reviewed_on":"2026-06-17"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"1 nap","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-19T08:10:04+00:00"},{"id":51446,"front":"<p>The old photograph managed to _______ a strong sense of nostalgia in her. <em>(felid\u00e9z \/ el\u0151h\u00edv)<\/em><\/p><p>The politician's speech was designed to _______ a sense of national pride among the citizens. <em>(kiv\u00e1lt \/ \u00e9breszt)<\/em><\/p><p>Certain smells can _______ vivid memories of childhood. <em>(el\u0151id\u00e9z \/ felid\u00e9z)<\/em><\/p><p>The artist's abstract work aims to _______ a range of emotions rather than depict a specific scene. <em>(kelt \/ el\u0151id\u00e9z)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 197, 94);\">felid\u00e9z \/ <\/span><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 197, 94);\">el\u0151id\u00e9z<\/span><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 197, 94);\">\/ kiv\u00e1lt \/<\/span><\/p><p><span>Negative meaning (HU): elnyom \/ elfojt \/ megakad\u00e1lyoz<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a memory = eml\u00e9ket felid\u00e9z (pl. The scent of freshly baked bread can often _______ a memory of childhood.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ an emotion = \u00e9rz\u00e9st kiv\u00e1lt\/kelt (pl. The sad music seemed to _______ an emotion of deep sorrow.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a response = v\u00e1laszt kiv\u00e1lt (pl. His provocative statement was intended to _______ a strong response from the audience.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ an image = k\u00e9pet felid\u00e9z (pl. The description was so vivid it managed to _______ an image in my mind.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>evoke<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>evocation<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>evoke<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: evoke memories \/ evoke emotions \/ evoke a feeling \/ evoke a response<\/span><\/p><p>similar: arouse \/ elicit \/ call forth \/ conjure up<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: suppress \/ quash \/ stifle<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"evoke\nevocation","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-11","reviewed_on":"2026-06-18","due_at":"2026-06-18T15:08:33+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-17T20:30:27+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-11","reviewed_on":"2026-06-17"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-21T15:06:48+00:00"},{"id":51447,"front":"<p>Someone tried to _______ with the lock on the back door, but couldn&#039;t get it open. <em>(piszk\u00e1l \/ babr\u00e1l)<\/em><\/p><p>It is illegal to _______ with the evidence in a criminal investigation. <em>(manipul\u00e1l \/ meghamis\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p>Please do not _______ with the settings on the thermostat; it&#039;s set perfectly. <em>(\u00e1ll\u00edtgat \/ m\u00f3dos\u00edtgat)<\/em><\/p><p>The security system is designed to prevent anyone from attempting to _______ with the internal wiring. <em>(belepiszk\u00e1l \/ hozz\u00e1ny\u00fal)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">piszk\u00e1l \/ babr\u00e1l \/ manipul\u00e1l<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): \u00e9rintetlen\u00fcl hagy \/ b\u00e9k\u00e9n hagy \/ nem ny\u00fal hozz\u00e1<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ with something = piszk\u00e1l\/babr\u00e1l valamivel (pl. Don&#039;t _______ with the wires.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ with evidence = bizony\u00edt\u00e9kot manipul\u00e1l\/hamis\u00edt (pl. He was accused of trying to _______ with evidence.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ with the controls = a kezel\u0151szervekkel babr\u00e1l\/\u00e1ll\u00edtgat (pl. The child kept trying to _______ with the controls.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ with a device = egy eszk\u00f6zzel piszk\u00e1l\/babr\u00e1l (pl. Someone had clearly tried to _______ with the device.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>tamper<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>tampering<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>tamper<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: tamper with \/ tamper proof \/ tamper resistant \/ tamper evident<\/span><\/p><p>similar: meddle \/ interfere \/ falsify \/ manipulate<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: leave alone \/ preserve \/ safeguard<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"tamper\ntampering","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":1,"ease_factor":230,"repetitions":1,"lapses":1,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-11","reviewed_on":"2026-06-18","due_at":"2026-06-18T15:08:26+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-17T20:29:33+00:00","interval":1,"ease_factor":230,"repetitions":1,"lapses":1,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-11","reviewed_on":"2026-06-17"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-18T20:18:31+00:00"}]},"url":"\/flashcards\/41\/study","version":"8d83705e9d61ecba4649149771a3068e","sharedProps":["errors","name","auth","sidebarOpen","billingEnabled","flash"]}</script><div id="app"></div><?php /**PATH /var/www/clients/client982/web3567/web/topwords.eu/storage/framework/views/8f9e2fe641acf94fac1df2caf467a820.blade.php ENDPATH**/ ?>